# Routes Folder
# 
# Purpose: Define API endpoints and route handlers
# 
# Best Practices:
# - Organize routes by resource/feature (e.g., poll.routes.ts, response.routes.ts)
# - Use Express Router for modular route definitions
# - Apply middleware at the route level (authentication, validation)
# - Keep route definitions clean - delegate to controllers
# - Use RESTful naming conventions for endpoints
# - Group related routes together
# - Document routes with comments or use OpenAPI/Swagger
# - Apply rate limiting and security middleware where needed
# 
# Example structure:
# - poll.routes.ts (/api/polls)
# - response.routes.ts (/api/responses)
# - ai.routes.ts (/api/ai)
# - health.routes.ts (/health)

